* cc is r68's other name of ccr (ori #Flag,cc); and ccr, sr are the registers in an instruction
* also where the source defines such a name (it went as an absolute address).
* fixed: 55f07bf 2026-10-11 r68togas: cc as ccr; register names defined as symbols
* expect text: 003c0001 023c0002 003c0004 4e714e71
Flag equ 1
 psect ccr_names,0,0,0,0,0
 ori #Flag,cc
 andi #2,cc
 ori #4,ccr
 nop
ccr equ 6
 ends
